1.1 Project Title
EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant
1.2 Introduction
EduGenie is a lightweight AI-powered educational assistant designed to simplify the learning process for students. It uses generative AI to provide smart answers, simple explanations, quizzes, summaries, and personalized learning recommendations.
The system is designed with a FastAPI backend and a simple HTML and CSS frontend. It combines cloud-based AI capabilities with a lightweight web interface. EduGenie-Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant_Document.docx
1.3 Problem Statement
Students often face difficulty understanding complex educational concepts and finding suitable learning resources. Reading lengthy educational content can also make quick revision difficult.
Therefore, there is a need for an intelligent learning assistant that can:
Answer student questions.
Explain difficult concepts simply.
Generate quizzes.
Summarize lengthy content.
Provide structured learning recommendations.
1.4 Proposed Solution
EduGenie provides a single web-based platform where learners can interact with AI for different educational needs.
The system provides:
Question and Answer
Concept Explanation
Quiz Generation
Text Summarization
Personalized Learning Recommendations
These functions are described in the project document. EduGenie-Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant_Document.docx
1.5 Target Users
School students
College students
Self-learners
Beginners
Educational content users
1.6 Project Benefits
Simplifies complex concepts.
Provides quick answers.
